      <p class="eyebrow">Every morning</p>
      <h2>English, Maths and Science</h2>
      <p>Three lessons before lunch. <strong>English</strong> is real books, real writing and a lot of talking. <strong>Maths</strong> starts with objects and works up. <strong>Science</strong> is experiments first, explanations second.</p>
      <p>Cambridge Primary is recognised everywhere, so moving on later is easy.</p>
